                    .subheading.mb-5
                        | Toulouse, France ·
                        a(href='mailto:info@gabrielemarra.tech') info@gabrielemarra.tech
                    p.lead.mb-4
                        strong Software Engineer
                        | specializing in
                        strong space cybersecurity,
                        | with experience across research, product engineering, and satellite software. I build secure, production-ready systems for space and ground segments, from containerized services and mission-control integrations to flight software and simulation tooling. Across industry and research, I have led satellite flight software initiatives and contributed to security-focused products in the space domain.
                    p.lead.mb-5
                        | Alongside industry work, I hold a Master's degree in Computer Engineering and have contributed to research published at NDSS and 3S in the space security domain. I am comfortable moving between system design, implementation, integration, and security-focused problem solving, with hands-on experience in Rust, Python, Java, gRPC, and embedded and backend software.
