            // Experience
            section#experience.resume-section
                .resume-section-content
                    h2.mb-5 Experience

                    .resume-entry.mb-5
                        .resume-entry-header
                            h3.mb-0 Software Security Engineer
                            .subheading.mb-3 CYSEC
                        .resume-entry-meta
                            span.text-primary 01/2025 - Present
                            .span.text-secondary Toulouse, France
                        .resume-entry-body
                            p
                                | Responsible for the ground-side development of
                                strong ARCA Satlink,
                                | CYSEC's Rust-based SDLS implementation for secure space-ground communications, deployed as a containerized service. I brought Satlink Ground from demo stage to a production-ready solution used by multiple customers in their ground systems and mission control software.
                            p
                                | My work includes delivering and maintaining a containerized
                                strong gRPC
                                | service for securing CCSDS TC, TM, AOS, and USLP Frames, improving reliability, packaging, and release quality for production deployments. I also extended SDLS capabilities through custom Extended Procedures and developed a demo MCS and UI to support integration validation and product demonstrations.

                    .resume-entry.mb-5
                        .resume-entry-header
                            h3.mb-0 Space Cybersecurity Researcher
                            .subheading.mb-3 CISPA - Helmholtz Centre for Information Security
                        .resume-entry-meta
                            span.text-primary 10/2023 - 03/2024
                            .span.text-secondary Saarbrücken, Germany
                        .resume-entry-body
                            p
                                | Contributed to
                                strong two research projects
                                | at CISPA. First, I designed an
                                strong application sandboxing solution
                                | for
                                //TODO add "target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'" here and not only in the html
                                a(href='https://www.tu.berlin/en/raumfahrttechnik/research/current-projects/raccoon') RACCOON OS,
                                | an open-source satellite operating system developed on Yocto Linux with leading universities, assessing the feasibility of secure application isolation for space missions. This work later led to the SpaceSec 2024 paper
                                a(href='#sandboxing-in-space-paper') Sandboxing in Space.
                            p
                                | Second, I designed and developed a
                                strong satellite simulator and honeypot
                                | to emulate satellite and ground-station behavior for cybersecurity research. This work later led to the NDSS 2026 paper
                                a(href='#honeysat-paper') HoneySat.

                    .resume-entry.mb-5
                        .resume-entry-header
                            h3.mb-0 Flight Software Engineer - CubeSat Mission
                            .subheading.mb-3 PoliSpace Association
                        .resume-entry-meta
                            span.text-primary 11/2021 - 09/2023
                            .span.text-secondary Milan, Italy
                        .resume-entry-body
                            p
                                strong Led a team of four software engineers
                                | in flight software testing and requirements definition. Actively collaborated on the creation of secure and well-designed CubeSat software,
                                | balancing software quality, mission constraints, and cross-team coordination.


                    .resume-entry.mb-5
                        .resume-entry-header
                            h3.mb-0 Software Engineer Freelancer
                            .subheading.mb-3 Level11 Software on Fiverr
                        .resume-entry-meta
                            span.text-primary 2022 - Present
                        .resume-entry-body
                            p
                                | Developed various software solutions, including
                                strong web apps, backends, and neural network algorithms
                                | for multiple clients. I gained experience in working with lots of tasks for numerous customers.

